 weaving holds itself together.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-acce889d57707b90", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Bracklin weaving\", \"value\": \"Double-weft interlock weaving locks, not crosses, binding two layers tightly, self-holding.\"}", "result": "Key 'Bracklin weaving' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Bracklin": "Textile from Grennock mountain sheep, traceable to specific flock.", "Grennock fleece": "Produces exceptionally warm textiles.", "Bracklin weaving": "Double-weft interlock weaving locks, not crosses, binding two layers tightly, self-holding."}}, {"segment_index": 8, "segment_text": "The cloth is used mainly for winter outerwear and ceremonial robes.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-815e69f89f32752e", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Bracklin uses\", \"value\": \"Mainly for winter outerwear and ceremonial robes.\"}", "result": "Key 'Bracklin uses' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Bracklin": "Textile from Grennock mountain sheep, traceable to specific flock.", "Grennock fleece": "Produces exceptionally warm textiles.", "Bracklin weaving": "Double-weft interlock weaving locks, not crosses, binding two layers tightly, self-holding.", "Bracklin uses": "Mainly for winter outerwear and ceremonial robes."}}, {"segment_index": 9, "segment_text": "Those are bracklin's two main uses — winter outerwear and ceremonial robes, nothing else.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8f489c7e739b4d44", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Bracklin uses\", \"value\": \"Mainly for winter outerwear and ceremonial robes, exclusively.\"}", "result": "Key 'Bracklin uses' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Bracklin": "Textile from Grennock mountain sheep, traceable to specific flock.", "Grennock fleece": "Produces exceptionally warm textiles.", "Bracklin weaving": "Double-weft interlock weaving locks, not crosses, binding two layers tightly, self-holding.", "Bracklin uses": "Mainly for winter outerwear and ceremonial robes, exclusively."}}, {"segment_index": 10, "segment_text": "Both draw on the same warmth, just for different occasions.", "tool_calls": [], "kv_snapshot": {"Bracklin": "Textile from Grennock mountain sheep, traceable to specific flock.", "Grennock fleece": "Produces exceptionally warm textiles.", "Bracklin weaving": "Double-weft interlock weaving locks, not crosses, binding two layers tightly, self-holding.", "Bracklin uses": "Mainly for winter outerwear and ceremonial robes, exclusively."}}, {"segment_index": 11, "segment_text": "Before it is dyed, bracklin fabric ranges from warm ivory to ash grey.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8adc23a2e90afb2a", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Bracklin color\", \"value\": \"Ranges from warm ivory to ash grey before dyeing.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-ba880de42b83ca33", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Bracklin uses\"}", "result": "Key 'Bracklin uses' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a1adde958352b07d", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Bracklin color\", \"value\": \"Ranges from warm ivory to ash grey before dyeing.\"}", "result": "Key 'Bracklin color' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Bracklin": "Textile from Grennock mountain sheep, traceable to specific flock.", "Grennock fleece": "Produces exceptionally warm textiles.", "Bracklin weaving": "Double-weft interlock weaving locks, not crosses, binding two layers tightly, self-holding.", "Bracklin color": "Ranges from warm ivory to ash grey before dyeing."}}, {"segment_index": 12, "segment_text": "That ivory-to-grey range comes straight from the sheep's own coat.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-96d0fa94c79eb830", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Bracklin color\", \"value\": \"Ranges from warm ivory to ash grey, natural sheep colors.\"}", "result": "Ke