Quessaro' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The discussion is about fruits.", "Mirelon": "Fruit with deep indigo-black skin, white powdery bloom, vivid saffron-yellow flesh, Thyrsocarpus niveus.", "Mirelon_elevation": "Mirelons grow at elevations between 900 to 4000 feet.", "Quessaro": "Fruit often mistaken for mirelon, but from a different genus."}}, {"segment_index": 8, "segment_text": "Its rind is a mottled rust-orange, faintly ribbed rather than smooth, and its flesh is a milky, greenish-white colored by a compound called ossalin.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9088b88007e3d0dc", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Quessaro_description\", \"value\": \"Rind is mottled rust-orange, faintly ribbed, flesh milky greenish-white due to ossalin.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b567c111069821f9", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Mirelon_elevation\"}", "result": "Key 'Mirelon_elevation' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a9157382e7e80161", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Quessaro_description\", \"value\": \"Rind is mottled rust-orange, faintly ribbed, flesh milky greenish-white due to ossalin.\"}", "result": "Key 'Quessaro_description' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The discussion is about fruits.", "Mirelon": "Fruit with deep indigo-black skin, white powdery bloom, vivid saffron-yellow flesh, Thyrsocarpus niveus.", "Quessaro": "Fruit often mistaken for mirelon, but from a different genus.", "Quessaro_description": "Rind is mottled rust-orange, faintly ribbed, flesh milky greenish-white due to ossalin."}}, {"segment_index": 9, "segment_text": "Botanists classify it as Ferrulia campestris.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-99617d821766bc86", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Quessaro_botanical_name\", \"value\": \"Quessaro is classified as Ferrulia campestris.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b85546de6a2fa96f", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Mirelon\"}", "result": "Key 'Mirelon' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-815573324ae626ba", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Quessaro_botanical_name\", \"value\": \"Quessaro is classified as Ferrulia campestris.\"}", "result": "Key 'Quessaro_botanical_name' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The discussion is about fruits.", "Quessaro": "Fruit often mistaken for mirelon, but from a different genus.", "Quessaro_description": "Rind is mottled rust-orange, faintly ribbed, flesh milky greenish-white due to ossalin.", "Quessaro_botanical_name": "Quessaro is classified as Ferrulia campestris."}}, {"segment_index": 10, "segment_text": "Unlike many highland fruits, the Quessaro is harvested while still firm and finishes softening over the following week in open-air storage.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a4ae2af6cd178297", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Quessaro_ripening\", \"value\": \"Harvested firm, softens over a week in open-air storage.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-966ad6acc17dc75e", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Quessaro_botanical_name\"}", "result": "Key 'Quessaro_botanical_name' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b3f1c0c841f96c77", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Quessaro_ripening\", \"value\": \"Harvested firm, softens over a week in open-air storage.\"}", "result": "Key 'Quessaro_ripening' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The discussion is about fruits.", "Quessaro": "Fruit often mistaken for mirelon, but from a different genus.", "Quessaro_description": "Rind is mottled rust-orange, faintly ribbed, flesh milky greenish-white due to ossalin.", "Quessaro_ripening": "Harvested firm, softens over a week in open-air storage."}}, {"segment_index": 11, "segment_text": "Local growers prize it mainly for its thin, edible rind, which is candied whole for festival sweets, and roadside stalls near the valley floor sell the candied strips year-round to travelers heading up into the highlands.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b337c099ade4ba06", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Quessaro_rind_use\", \"value\": \"Rind is candied whole for festival sweets, sold year-round at roadside stalls.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8b0485c7f90b1778", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Quessaro_ripening\"}", "result": "Key 'Quessaro_ripening' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8353e036fe87c3fb", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Quessaro_rind_use\", \"value\": \"Rind is candied whole for festival sweets, sold year-round at roadside stalls.\"}", "result": "Key 'Quessaro_rind_use' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The discussion is about fruits.", "Quessaro": "Fruit often mistaken for mirelon, but from a different genus.", "Quessaro_description": "Rind is mottled rust-orange, faintly ribbed, flesh milky greenish-white due to ossalin.", "Quessaro_rind_use": "Rind is candied whole for festival sweets, sold year-round at roadside stalls."}}, {"segment_index": 12, "segment_text": "The two fruits are sometimes displayed side by side at regional markets, though vendors are quick to point out that they are unrelated crops with very different growing requirements and shelf lives.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b2a777a387e107d9", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Quessaro_vs_mirelon\", \"value\": \"Vendors distinguish Quessaro and mirelon, highlighting different growing needs and shelf lives.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a67c108ff88f4c5e", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Quessaro_description\"}", "result": "Key 'Quessaro_description' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-94de75d3cd7f06cb", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Quessaro_vs_mirelon\", \"value\": \"Vendors distinguish Quessaro and mirelon, highlighting different growing needs and shelf lives.\"}", "result": "Key 'Quessaro_vs_mirelon' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The discussion is about fruits.", "Quessaro": "Fruit often mistaken for mirelon, but from a different genus.", "Quessaro_rind_use": "Rind is candied whole for festival sweets, sold year-round at roadside stalls.", "Quessaro_vs_mirelon": "Vendors distinguish Quessaro and mirelon, highlighting different growing needs and shelf lives."}}]}, "final_kv": {"topic": "The discussion is about fruits.", "Quessaro": "Fruit often mistaken for mirelon, but from a different genus.", "Quessaro_rind_use": "Rind is candied whole for festival sweets, sold year-round at roadside stalls.", "Quessaro_vs_mirelon": "Vendors distinguish Quessaro and mirelon, highlighting different growing needs and shelf lives."}, "recall_raw": "Question 1: 5\nQuestion 2: 5\nQuestion 3: 5\nQuestion 4: 5\nQuestion 5: 5\nPassage Difficulty: 7\nQuestion Difficulty: 7", "parsed_answers": {"1": [5], "2": [5], "3": [5], "4": [5], "5": [5]}, "difficulty": {"passage": 7, "question": 7}, "parse_errors": [], "questions": [{"q_id": "QF_V2_01", "question": "Which of the following correctly describe the outer appearance of the Mirelon? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "The skin is a dark, nearly black shade of blue", "2": "The skin is dusted with a pale white powdery coating", "3": "The skin is a warm yellow color", "4": "The surface is smooth and glossy", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QF_V2_02", "question": "Which of the following are true of the Mirelon's flesh? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "The interior is a warm, deep golden-yellow", "2": "The color of the flesh comes from a pigment called nivellin", "3": "The interior is a soft pale violet", "4": "The color of the flesh comes from a pigment called thornellin", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QF_V2_03", "question": "What is the botanical name of the Mirelon? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Thyrsocarpus niveus", "2": "Thyrsocarpus pallens", "3": "Spinofex arbens", "4": "Thyrsocarpus mirabilis", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QF_V2_04", "question": "Which combination correctly describes the Mirelon?", "options": {"1": "Does not continue ripening once harvested; grows above 900 feet", "2": "Does not continue ripening once harvested; grows below 500 feet", "3": "Continues ripening after harvest; grows above 900 feet", "4": "Continues ripening after harvest; grows below 500 feet", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QF_V2_05", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes a mirelon's feature? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Its outer skin is pale yellow with fine raised bristles", "2": "Its flesh is colored by a compound called shortellin", "3": "It is a climacteric fruit that continues ripening after harvest", "4": "Its botanical name Thyrsocarpus rufa", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [5], "qtype": "content"}], "metrics": {"per_statement_correct": 15, "per_statement_total": 25, "per_statement_accuracy": 0.6, "exact_match_correct": 1, "exact_match_total": 5, "exact_match_accuracy": 0.2, "slot_utilization": 1.0}}
{"id": "wm_application_listening_qa:C2-stream:r1:martial_arts:control", "condition_id": "C2-stream", "condition_name": "Human cognitive limits framing (streaming encode) (sentence-segmented)", "segment_unit": "sentence", "repeat_index": 1, "topic_id": "martial_arts", "title": "Martial Arts — Velthrak", "level": "control", "encoding_log": {"content": ["Topic: martial arts", "Velthrak is a grappling art where striking of any kind is not permitted.", "Its signature move is the sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin.", "Full-resistance sparring is off-limits for anyone with under two years of experience.", "Originating in the Dalviri Highlands, velthrak is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council, which was founded in 1947.", "Watching a match in person gives a much better sense of the rhythm than reading about it ever could.", "The holds and reversals happen quickly, and spectators often find themselves leaning forward without quite realizing it.", "It has the kind of quiet intensity that keeps people coming back to watch, even if they never step onto the mat themselves.", "Even seasoned fans tend to describe it as more absorbing in person than any clip or photo manages to capture, and gyms that host open practice sessions often draw a small crowd of onlookers just for that reason."], "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-810dfc3a5da28427", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"topic\", \"value\": \"Martial arts\"}", "result": "Key 'topic' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-bc9fb1cc96904937", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak\", \"value\": \"Grappling art, no striking allowed.\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-ac17215548933158", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sornek\", \"value\": \"Signature move of Velthrak, sweeping hip throw leading to floor pin.\"}", "result": "Key 'sornek' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a5ba40662e64aeda", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\", \"value\": \"Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years' experience.\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a66cb2e3e6d0e253", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"origin\", \"value\": \"Velthrak from Dalviri Highlands, governed by Dalviri Arts Council since 1947.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-81ba5479d7a8ae65", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"topic\"}", "result": "Key 'topic' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-85a63c03853e05a4", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"origin\", \"value\": \"Velthrak from Dalviri Highlands, governed by Dalviri Arts Council since 1947.\"}", "result": "Key 'origin' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a5b3d78aee93450f", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"spectator_reaction\", \"value\": \"Spectators lean forward, captivated by fast-paced holds and reversals.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-810d737d32f60f57", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8f9edbd4379da13b", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"spectator_reaction\", \"value\": \"Spectators lean forward, captivated by fast-paced holds and reversals.\"}", "result": "Key 'spectator_reaction' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-ab73f0fa2c8f69ba", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"atmosphere\", \"value\": \"Quiet intensity draws spectators, even non-practitioners.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8318bb054ac821d2", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"spectat