weeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-ac17215548933158", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sornek\", \"value\": \"Signature move of Velthrak, sweeping hip throw leading to floor pin.\"}", "result": "Key 'sornek' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art, no striking allowed.", "sornek": "Signature move of Velthrak, sweeping hip throw leading to floor pin."}}, {"segment_index": 4, "segment_text": "Full-resistance sparring is off-limits for anyone with under two years of experience.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a5ba40662e64aeda", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\", \"value\": \"Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years' experience.\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art, no striking allowed.", "sornek": "Signature move of Velthrak, sweeping hip throw leading to floor pin.", "sparring_rule": "Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years' experience."}}, {"segment_index": 5, "segment_text": "Originating in the Dalviri Highlands, velthrak is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council, which was founded in 1947.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a66cb2e3e6d0e253", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"origin\", \"value\": \"Velthrak from Dalviri Highlands, governed by Dalviri Arts Council since 1947.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-81ba5479d7a8ae65", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"topic\"}", "result": "Key 'topic' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-85a63c03853e05a4", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"origin\", \"value\": \"Velthrak from Dalviri Highlands, governed by Dalviri Arts Council since 1947.\"}", "result": "Key 'origin' written."}], "kv_snapsh