, captivated by fast-paced holds and reversals."}}, {"segment_index": 8, "segment_text": "It has the kind of quiet intensity that keeps people coming back to watch, even if they never step onto the mat themselves.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-ab73f0fa2c8f69ba", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"atmosphere\", \"value\": \"Quiet intensity draws spectators, even non-practitioners.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8318bb054ac821d2", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"spectator_reaction\"}", "result": "Key 'spectator_reaction' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-89b114fb8419df30", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"atmosphere\", \"value\": \"Quiet intensity draws spectators, even non-practitioners.\"}", "result": "Key 'atmosphere' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak": "Grappling art, no striking allowed.", "sornek": "Signature move of Velthrak, sweeping hip throw leading to floor pin.", "origin": "Velthrak from Dalviri Highlands, governed by Dalviri Arts Council since 1947.", "atmosphere": "Quiet intensity draws spectators, even non-practitioners."}}, {"segment_index": 9, "segment_text": "Even seasoned fans tend to describe it as more absorbing in person than any clip or photo manages to capture, and gyms that host open practice sessions often draw a small crowd of onlookers just for that reason.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a2da655c3ffe9957", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"engagement\", \"value\": \"Live Velthrak more engaging than media, attracts crowds to practice sessions.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-92b542d3f3eacdb8", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"atmosphere\", \"value\": \"Live Velthrak more engaging than media, attracts crowds to practic