 the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA02", "question": "Which of the following accurately describe the sornek? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "It is the signature technique of velthrak", "2": "It involves a hip throw", "3": "It starts with a spinning elbow strike to the opponent's shoulder", "4": "It begins with a leg pick", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA03", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes the governing body of velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "The Dalviri Arts Council governs velthrak certification", "2": "The official governing body of velthrak was formed in 1967", "3": "The official governing body of velthrak was formed in 1947", "4": "The Dalviri Federation of Combat Arts governs velthrak certification", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 3], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA04", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Full-resistance sparring involves kicking and punching", "2": "Practitioners must complete 200 strikes on a bag before each session", "3": "Practitioners must practice for three years before engaging in full-resistance sparring", "4": "Practitioners must practice for two years before engaging in full-resistance sparring", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [4], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA05", "question": "Which of the following are restrictions that apply in velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Striking an opponent in any form is against the rules", "2": "A person who has practiced velthrak for one year cannot engage in full-resistance sparring", "3": "The sornek may only be performed in championship-level bouts", "4": "All competition surfaces must be approved by the Dalviri Federation of Combat Arts", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}], "metrics": {"per_statement_correct": 19, "per_stat