artial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art, win by throwing and pinning, no strikes allowed."}}, {"segment_index": 4, "segment_text": "Striking is off-limits at every level of competition, from practice rounds to sanctioned finals.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-96f2f13113df50a7", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak\", \"value\": \"Grappling art, win by throwing and pinning, no strikes allowed, rule applies universally.\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art, win by throwing and pinning, no strikes allowed, rule applies universally."}}, {"segment_index": 5, "segment_text": "Its signature move is the sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8c9d0a17760a368f", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"signature_move\", \"value\": \"Sornek, sweeping hip throw ending in floor pin.\"}", "result": "Key 'signature_move' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art, win by throwing and pinning, no strikes allowed, rule applies universally.", "signature_move": "Sornek, sweeping hip throw ending in floor pin."}}, {"segment_index": 6, "segment_text": "To do a sornek, the thrower drives a hip beneath the opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down to the floor.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-bcaa87bcca1d17e0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"signature_move\", \"value\": \"Sornek, sweeping hip throw, thrower drives hip under opponent's center of mass.\"}", "result": "Key 'signature_move' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art, win by throwing and pinning, no strikes allowed, rule applies universally.", "signature_move": "Sornek, sweeping hip throw, thrower drives hip under opponent's center of mass."}}, {"segment_index": 7, "segment_text": "The thrower's hip acts as a fulcrum: once it clears the opponent's centre of mass, gravity finishes the throw.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a4bdf5128d59ef82", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"signature_move\", \"value\": \"Sornek, sweeping hip throw, thrower drives hip under opponent's center of mass, gravity completes.\"}", "result": "Key 'signature_move' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art, win by throwing and pinning, no strikes allowed, rule applies universally.", "signature_move": "Sornek, sweeping hip throw, thrower drives hip under opponent's center of mass, gravity completes."}}, {"segment_index": 8, "segment_text": "No other velthrak technique is as recognizable.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-96c5930012725304", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"signature_move\", \"value\": \"Sornek, sweeping hip throw, most recognizable velthrak technique.\"}", "result": "Key 'signature_move' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art, win by throwing and pinning, no strikes allowed, rule applies universally.", "signature_move": "Sornek, sweeping hip throw, most recognizable velthrak technique."}}, {"segment_index": 9, "segment_text": "Full-resistance sparring is off-limits for anyone with under two years of experience.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b24d70b516f1daf6", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\", \"value\": \"Beginners can't do full-resistance sparring until two years of experience.\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art, win by throwing and pinning, no strikes allowed, rule applies universally.", "signature_move": "Sornek, sweeping hip throw, most recognizable velthrak technique.", "sparring_rule": "Beginners can't do full-resistance sparring until two years of experience."}}, {"segment_index": 10, "segment_text": "The rule protects newer practitioners until their defensive technique is solid enough to handle full resistance after two years.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-847b5acc5bd037ce", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\", \"value\": \"Beginners can't do full-resistance sparring until defensive technique is solid, typically after two years.\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art, win by throwing and pinning, no strikes allowed, rule applies universally.", "signature_move": "Sornek, sweeping hip throw, most recognizable velthrak technique.", "sparring_rule": "Beginners can't do full-resistance sparring until defensive technique is solid, typically after two years."}}, {"segment_index": 11, "segment_text": "Coaches enforce the two year restriction strictly — no exceptions are made regardless of size or prior combat experience.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a4ae84e65205ac5c", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\", \"value\": \"Beginners can't do full-resistance sparring until defensive technique is solid, typically after two years, no exceptions.\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art, win by throwing and pinning, no strikes allowed, rule applies universally.", "signature_move": "Sornek, sweeping hip throw, most recognizable velthrak technique.", "sparring_rule": "Beginners can't do full-resistance sparring until defensive technique is solid, typically after two years, no exceptions."}}, {"segment_index": 12, "segment_text": "Originating in the Dalviri Highlands, it is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council, which was founded in 1947.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b54377b8477e2846", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"origin\", \"value\": \"Dalviri Highlands, governed by Dalviri Arts Council since 1947.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-817a2b5a1ed3966f", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\", \"value\": \"Originating in the Dalviri Highlands, governed by Dalviri Arts Council since 1947.\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art, win by throwing and pinning, no strikes allowed, rule applies universally.", "signature_move": "Sornek, sweeping hip throw, most recognizable velthrak technique.", "sparring_rule": "Originating in the Dalviri Highlands, governed by Dalviri Arts Council since 1947."}}, {"segment_index": 13, "segment_text": "Since its 1947 founding, the Dalviri Arts Council has set grades, licensed instructors, and overseen all sanctioned competition worldwide.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8ffad2a4dc594571", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"council_role\", \"value\": \"Sets grades, licenses instructors, oversees competitions globally.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-be35e32aba52485f", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-927105968bc5831d", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"council_role\", \"value\": \"Sets grades, licenses instructors, oversees competitions globally.\"}", "result": "Key 'council_role' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art, win by throwing and pinning, no strikes allowed, rule applies universally.", "signature_move": "Sornek, sweeping hip throw, most recognizable velthrak technique.", "council_role": "Sets grades, licenses instructors, oversees competitions globally."}}, {"segment_index": 14, "segment_text": "The Dalviri Arts Council's 1947 founding charter is the sole governing document for all certification to this day.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-89d1ec257b547b7d", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"governing_document\", \"value\": \"Dalviri Arts Council's 1947 founding charter governs all certification.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a446eb34513f32d3", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"council_role\"}", "result": "Key 'council_role' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b6ce691c609104a4", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"governing_document\", \"value\": \"Dalviri Arts Council's 1947 founding charter governs all certification.\"}", "result": "Key 'governing_document' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art, win by throwing and pinning, no strikes allowed, rule applies universally.", "signature_move": "Sornek, sweeping hip throw, most recognizable velthrak technique.", "governing_document": "Dalviri Arts Council's 1947 founding charter governs all certification."}}]}, "final_kv": {"topic": "Martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art, win by throwing and pinning, no strikes allowed, rule applies universally.", "signature_move": "Sornek, sweeping hip throw, most recognizable velthrak technique.", "governing_document": "Dalviri Arts Council's 1947 founding charter governs all certification."}, "recall_raw": "Question 1: 1,2\nQuestion 2: 1,2\nQuestion 3: 1,3\nQuestion 4: 5\nQuestion 5: 1\nPassage Difficulty: 5\nQuestion Difficulty: 6", "parsed_answers": {"1": [1, 2], "2": [1, 2], "3": [1, 3], "4": [5], "5": [1]}, "difficulty": {"passage": 5, "question": 6}, "parse_errors": [], "questions": [{"q_id": "QMA01", "question": "Which of the following accurately describe the style of velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Velthrak is a grappling-focused art", "2": "Velthrak does not permit striking of any kind", "3": "Velthrak is a striking-focused art", "4": "Velthrak allows limited strikes during competition", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA02", "question": "Which of the following accurately describe the sornek? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "It is the signature technique of velthrak", "2": "It involves a hip throw", "3": "It starts with a spinning elbow strike to the opponent's shoulder", "4": "It begins with a leg pick", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA03", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes the governing body of velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "The Dalviri Arts Council governs velthrak certification", "2": "The official governing body of velthrak was formed in 1967", "3": "The official governing body of velthrak was formed in 1947", "4": "The Dalviri Federation of Combat Arts governs velthrak certification", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 3], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA04", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Full-resistance sparring involves kicking and punching", "2": "Practitioners must complete 200 strikes on a bag before each session", "3": "Practitioners must practice for three years before engaging in full-resistance sparring", "4": "Practitioners must practice for two years before engaging in full-resistance sparring", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [4], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA05", "question": "Which of the following are restrictions that apply in velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Striking an opponent in any form is against the rules", "2": "A person who has practiced velthrak for one year cannot engage in full-resistance sparring", "3": "The sornek may only be performed in championship-level bouts", "4": "All competition surfaces must be approved by the Dalviri Federation of Combat Arts", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}], "metrics": {"per_statement_correct": 22, "per_statement_total": 25, "per_statement_accuracy": 0.88, "exact_match_correct": 3, "exact_match_total": 5, "exact_match_accuracy": 0.6, "slot_utilization": 1.0}}
