r pin.", "sparring_rules": "Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years, protects newer practitioners.", "origin": "Velthrak originates in the Dalviri Highlands, governed by Dalviri Arts Council since 1947."}}, {"segment_index": 13, "segment_text": "Since its 1947 founding, the Dalviri Arts Council has set grades, licensed instructors, and overseen all sanctioned competition worldwide.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-afa23081a0bd216a", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"council_role\", \"value\": \"Dalviri Arts Council sets grades, licenses instructors, oversees competitions globally.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-bc70ae57c1312b04", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rules\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rules' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-892063414552f1c7", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"council_role\", \"value\": \"Dalviri Arts Council sets grades, licenses instructors, oversees competitions globally.\"}", "result": "Key 'council_role' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak": "Grappling art, win by throwing and pinning, no strikes allowed, rule applies universally.", "signature_move": "Sornek, sweeping hip throw, disrupts opponent's balance, leads to floor pin.", "origin": "Velthrak originates in the Dalviri Highlands, governed by Dalviri Arts Council since 1947.", "council_role": "Dalviri Arts Council sets grades, licenses instructors, oversees competitions globally."}}, {"segment_index": 14, "segment_text": "The Dalviri Arts Council's 1947 founding charter is the sole governing document for all certification to this day.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a5b45feaa34a6a7f", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"council_charter\", \"value\": \"1947 charter governs all certification, unchanged to this day.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full 